{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a looping space. <br>Move forward if nothing seems strange, but turn back if you sense something unusual. <br>Make the right choices repeatedly, and you might just escape\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Eight Strange Corridors&quot; is an anomaly-spotting game inspired by &quot;Exit 8.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> </i></strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD + Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Hold Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight: F</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: ESC / E (Check remaining undiscovered anomalies)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same anomaly will not appear again until all have been found.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may upload or stream gameplay without prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is allowed only through official features provided by each streaming platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the game\u2019s title in thumbnails or stream titles, or linking to the page in the description, is greatly appreciated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages arising from streaming or video posting of this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima